WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.185 --> 00:00:10.785
In tutorial 7.10, you'll read your
weekly report, see what changed,

00:00:10.835 --> 00:00:12.268
and know what to do next.

00:00:13.309 --> 00:00:17.409
First, open Reports and choose
Weekly site report as the type.

00:00:17.459 --> 00:00:19.456
Then open this week's report.

00:00:21.763 --> 00:00:25.348
At the top, you see the headline,
your clicks, your impressions,

00:00:25.398 --> 00:00:29.469
the times you showed up in search, your
position, and the next step to take.

00:00:30.453 --> 00:00:33.903
This week in brief explains
what changed in plain words,

00:00:33.953 --> 00:00:36.604
with the actions to
take and what to watch.

00:00:37.982 --> 00:00:41.382
Next, Where visitors come from
shows your visits by channel,

00:00:41.432 --> 00:00:45.213
and Organic landing pages shows
where search visitors arrive.

00:00:46.453 --> 00:00:49.463
Then, Search queries and
pages lists your winners,

00:00:49.513 --> 00:00:54.776
losers and searches close to page one.
Content groups shows how each group did.

00:00:55.714 --> 00:00:59.989
Tracked keywords puts your live position
beside your average in Search Console,

00:01:00.039 --> 00:01:01.783
for every keyword you watch.

00:01:03.260 --> 00:01:07.060
Further down, Google Trends shows
interest in your main keywords,

00:01:07.110 --> 00:01:09.838
and your Search Console
check-in sits at the end.

00:01:11.264 --> 00:01:15.184
Now, What to do next ranks this
week's actions, and Written,

00:01:15.234 --> 00:01:18.313
waiting to be published
lists pages ready to go live.

00:01:19.718 --> 00:01:24.543
Each keyword ladder gets its own weekly
report too, showing which ladder pages,

00:01:24.593 --> 00:01:26.900
the rungs, have reached the top 10.

00:01:28.239 --> 00:01:33.814
Then open the weekly rankings report. Gains
and Drops count your pages' own moves,

00:01:33.864 --> 00:01:36.474
apart from moves of
the whole results page.

00:01:37.433 --> 00:01:40.933
Positions shows each keyword
on a computer and on a phone,

00:01:40.983 --> 00:01:43.737
and The results pages
shows who ranks above you.

00:01:45.915 --> 00:01:50.590
Below, Your own gains and Drops to
look at name each keyword that moved,

00:01:50.640 --> 00:01:54.911
and Moved with the results page shows
the moves that weren't about your page.

00:01:55.936 --> 00:01:59.561
Finally, Send it now sends the
report to your usual channels,

00:01:59.611 --> 00:02:03.367
and Share makes a read-only link
that stops working when you choose.

00:02:05.436 --> 00:02:10.051
So each week you know where visitors came
from, what moved, and what to do next.

00:02:11.936 --> 00:02:15.536
So, find this week's report,
read where visitors came from,

00:02:15.586 --> 00:02:19.736
check your searches and keywords, your
waiting pages, the rankings report,

00:02:19.786 --> 00:02:20.604
and share it.

00:02:21.588 --> 00:02:25.813
You know what to do next. Then check
if AI assistants name your business,

00:02:25.863 --> 00:02:27.760
in tutorial 8.1.
